      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, sure. But I think this is more related to how required dependencies from phony modules are handled.\n\nWhen you have `required: [\"libfoo\"]` in a `cc_binary`, do you want to have `lib/libfoo.so`, `lib64/libfoo.so`, or both? The answer is `lib64/libfoo.so` because `cc_binary` would be for 64-bit arch (in most cases). But if it was from a phony module, there\u0027s no good answer. Our current behavior is installing both.\n\nBut that has brought up an issue that CL tries to fix.",
